              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SHANNONTHOMAS1"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I am not much of a wine person and didn't have any on hand, but we had the other ingredients and used water instead of wine, and added freshly ground black pepper. It was FANTASTIC. We used it on hamburger steaks and my whole family loved it and wanted more. So simple, yet so delicious!!"
