            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Ilene Kramer"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The amount of wine in the recipe would require 1/2cup of salt to remotely work. So I used only 1/4 cup of Cabernet Sauvignon. The resulting color was a little on the pink side. Still worked well and was flavorful but not outstanding. Next time I will use some kind of stock instead of the wine.",
            "datePublished": "2017-10-10T23:56:36.780Z"
          },
          {
