            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "blue-eyes"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I'm so glad I tried this! I was wary after reading some of the reviews. I wanted a different sauce to go with the meatballs I just made-i'm tired of going with marinara or swedish. I found this and figured I didn't have much to lose. It is so good! I switched the wine for beef broth, it's the only change I made. Tastes like the gravy you'd get in a country cooking restaurant, and made my kitchen smell so good! This is a keeper, thanks!",
            "datePublished": "2008-09-04T14:41:28.557Z"
          },
